                                    "args": {
                                      "text": [
                                        "Register: Rivet\nmaintains valves.\nDot verifies\nreadings. Moxie\ncarries failed",
                                        "message copies.\nPip records faults\nand informs\nresidents. The\nclerk keeps the",
                                        "public access\nagreement. Slush\noffers his roof\ncrew for lodge\nrepairs, subject",
                                        "to the same\nwritten fault log."
